          "   uongozi      leadership",
          "",
          "   From nouns:",
          "   mhandisi ->  uhandisi  engineering",
          "",
          "   From adjectives, bare u-:",
          "   -zuri  ->  uzuri    beauty",
          "   -kubwa ->  ukubwa   size",
          "   -refu  ->  urefu    length",
          "",
          "Hear them:                         Press 1"
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Uhandisi. Uzuri. Ukubwa. Urefu."
        }
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "Even from nouns and numbers:",
          "",
          "   mtoto  ->  utoto    childhood",
          "   rafiki ->  urafiki  friendship",
          "   moja   ->  umoja    unity, oneness",
          "",
          "   Umoja ni nguvu.",
          "   Unity is strength.",
          "",
          "Hear them:                         Press 1",
          "",
          "Abstracts take u/u — no plural, as",
          "Lesson 7's law had it. When you",
          "meet an unknown u- word, strip the",
          "u and look for the friend beneath:",
